      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes sense that you feel this way when your past self feels like a stranger, but please know that this feeling of being \"dead\" is often just a symptom of deep pain, not the reality of who you are. The shame you carry is a heavy burden, but it doesn't define your worth or the future that still lies ahead. You are not alone in this struggle, and there are people who can help you carry this weight without having to face it by yourself.",
