    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "people can help carry the weight, sure, but they're only helping because they feel bad for me. it's pity. the version of me they \"rescued\" doesn't exist anymore. i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. it feels so pointless to keep performing this role of someone who is still alive when everyone's already decided i'm finished. there's no coming back from this.",
